ses/tag/rustsec%2Fv0.34.0).\r\n\r\n## What's Changed\r\n\r\n* cargo-audit: suggest unaffected newer versions by @djc in https://github.com/rustsec/rustsec/pull/1619\r\n* Set user agent for index clients by @djc in https://github.com/rustsec/rustsec/pull/1625\r\n* Report in JSON which warnings --deny promotes to errors by @Eljees in https://github.com/rustsec/rustsec/pull/1671\r\n* cargo-audit: add cargo-binstall metadata so prebuilt release binaries are used by @0xdea in https://github.com/rustsec/rustsec/pull/1731\r\n* docs(cargo-audit): explain target platform value discovery by @jdotc1 in https://github.com/rustsec/rustsec/pull/1726\r\n* audit: add update-db subcommand by @djc in https://github.com/rustsec/rustsec/pull/1735\r\n* audit: remove dependency on abscissa by @djc in https://github.com/rustsec/rustsec/pull/1737\r\n* fix(cargo-audit)!: Remove extra dot in `advisory-db..lock` by @hashcatHitman in https://github.com/rustsec/rustsec/pull/1744\r\n* audit: show potential solutions for warnings as well by @djc in https://github.com/rustsec/rustsec/pull/1745\r\n* audit: re-enable regression test by @djc in https://github.com/rustsec/rustsec/pull/1736","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/rustsec/rustsec/releases/440433555/reactions","total_count":1,"+1":1,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"mentions_count":5}